    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "I'm writing to apply for the Software Engineer position at Justworks. I'm drawn to the opportunity to own meaningful technical projects end-to-end on a team that clearly values both the product and the people building it."
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "At Salo Labs, I built the FastAPI and PostgreSQL backend for LinkLeaf, a QR-code business card platform I co-founded, set up a CI pipeline that runs migrations and the full test suite on every pull request, and wrote 133 API tests against a real database. I'd welcome the chance to bring that same ownership to Justworks' engineering team."
      }
